cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these numbers or this harness, please cite this repository."
title: "Local LLM Benchmark Suite: llama.cpp inference benchmarks on an AMD Ryzen AI Max+ 395 (Strix Halo)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nummenpää
    given-names: Matias
    alias: matnum
repository-code: "https://github.com/matnum/local-llm-benchmarks"
url: "https://github.com/matnum/local-llm-benchmarks"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-21"
keywords:
  - large language models
  - inference benchmark
  - llama.cpp
  - Vulkan
  - ROCm
  - AMD Strix Halo
  - unified memory
  - Finnish NLP
abstract: >-
  Throughput, latency, memory, power and tokens-per-watt for ten
  model/quantization cells on a 128 GB unified-memory AMD APU, measured with a
  pinned llama.cpp build on both the Vulkan and ROCm backends, plus a
  Finnish-capability axis on FIN-bench-v2 (cf formulation, prompt variant p0).
  Raw run data, rollups, generation scripts and the full test suite are tracked
  so every published number can be recomputed.
